<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8" />
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
<title>DefendX — Smart Modular Training Watch</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com" />
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin />
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Barlow+Condensed:wght@400;600;700;800;900&family=Barlow:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap" rel="stylesheet" />
<style>
  *, *::before, *::after { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }

  :root {
    --bg:       #080B0F;
    --bg2:      #0D1117;
    --bg3:      #131921;
    --surface:  #1A2230;
    --border:   rgba(255,255,255,0.07);
    --border2:  rgba(255,255,255,0.13);
    --accent:   #00E5A0;
    --accent2:  #00C4FF;
    --danger:   #FF4458;
    --text:     #F0F4FF;
    --muted:    #6B7FA3;
    --font-display: 'Barlow Condensed', sans-serif;
    --font-body:    'Barlow', sans-serif;
  }

  html { scroll-behavior: smooth; }
  body {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--text);
    font-family: var(--font-body);
    font-size: 16px;
    line-height: 1.6;
    overflow-x: hidden;
  }

  /* ── NAV ── */
  nav {
    position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; right: 0; z-index: 100;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 0 40px; height: 64px;
    background: rgba(8,11,15,0.85);
    backdrop-filter: blur(18px);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }
  .logo {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: 26px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.04em;
    color: var(--text);
  }
  .logo span { color: var(--accent); }
  nav ul { list-style: none; display: flex; gap: 32px; }
  nav ul a {
    text-decoration: none; color: var(--muted); font-size: 14px; font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }
  nav ul a:hover { color: var(--text); }
  .nav-cta {
    background: var(--accent); color: #000;
    padding: 8px 22px; border-radius: 4px;
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    text-transform: uppercase; text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.2s;
  }
  .nav-cta:hover { opacity: 0.85; }

  /* ── HERO ── */
  .hero {
    min-height: 100vh; display: flex; flex-direction: column;
    align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    padding: 120px 40px 80px;
    position: relative; overflow: hidden; text-align: center;
  }
  .hero-grid {
    position: absolute; inset: 0; z-index: 0;
    background-image:
      linear-gradient(rgba(0,229,160,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px),
      linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(0,229,160,0.04) 1px, transparent 1px);
    background-size: 60px 60px;
    mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 80% 70% at 50% 40%, black 30%, transparent 100%);
  }
  .hero-glow {
    position: absolute; top: 10%; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 600px; height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(0,229,160,0.12) 0%, transparent 70%);
    z-index: 0; pointer-events: none;
  }
  .hero-badge {
    display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px;
    background: rgba(0,229,160,0.1); border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,0.25);
    border-radius: 100px; padding: 6px 16px;
    font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent); margin-bottom: 28px; position: relative; z-index: 1;
    animation: fadeUp 0.6s ease both;
  }
  .badge-dot {
    width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--accent);
    animation: pulse 2s infinite;
  }
  @keyframes pulse {
    0%, 100% { opacity: 1; transform: scale(1); }
    50% { opacity: 0.5; transform: scale(1.3); }
  }
  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(64px, 10vw, 120px);
    font-weight: 900; line-height: 0.92;
    letter-spacing: -0.01em; text-transform: uppercase;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s 0.1s ease both;
  }
  .hero h1 em {
    font-style: normal;
    -webkit-text-stroke: 2px var(--accent);
    color: transparent;
  }
  .hero-sub {
    max-width: 560px; margin: 24px auto 0;
    font-size: 18px; font-weight: 300; color: var(--muted);
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s 0.2s ease both;
  }
  .hero-actions {
    display: flex; gap: 16px; margin-top: 44px; justify-content: center;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s 0.3s ease both;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: var(--accent); color: #000;
    padding: 14px 36px; border: none; border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
    transition: opacity 0.2s, transform 0.15s;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover { opacity: 0.9; transform: translateY(-1px); }
  .btn-ghost {
    background: transparent; color: var(--text);
    padding: 14px 36px; border: 1px solid var(--border2); border-radius: 4px;
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 18px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.06em; text-transform: uppercase;
    cursor: pointer; text-decoration: none; display: inline-block;
    transition: background 0.2s;
  }
  .btn-ghost:hover { background: var(--surface); }
  .hero-stats {
    display: flex; gap: 56px; margin-top: 72px; justify-content: center;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
    animation: fadeUp 0.7s 0.4s ease both;
  }
  .stat-item { text-align: center; }
  .stat-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 44px; font-weight: 900;
    color: var(--text); line-height: 1;
  }
  .stat-num span { color: var(--accent); }
  .stat-label { font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; margin-top: 4px; }

  /* ── WATCH SECTION ── */
  #watch { padding: 120px 40px; position: relative; }
  .section-label {
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--accent); font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 14px;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(40px, 6vw, 72px);
    font-weight: 800; line-height: 0.95; text-transform: uppercase;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .watch-layout {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 80px;
    align-items: center; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
  }
  .watch-visual {
    position: relative; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
  }
  .watch-frame {
    width: 280px; height: 320px;
    background: linear-gradient(145deg, #1E2D40 0%, #0D1A26 100%);
    border-radius: 52px;
    border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    position: relative; z-index: 2;
    box-shadow: 0 0 80px rgba(0,229,160,0.15), inset 0 1px 0 rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
  }
  .watch-screen {
    width: 200px; height: 220px;
    background: #060D14; border-radius: 38px;
    display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    gap: 10px; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .watch-time {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 42px; font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text); letter-spacing: -0.02em;
  }
  .watch-metric {
    display: flex; gap: 18px;
  }
  .watch-metric-item {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .watch-metric-val {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--accent); line-height: 1;
  }
  .watch-metric-lbl {
    font-size: 9px; color: var(--muted); letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase;
  }
  .watch-arc {
    position: absolute; bottom: -4px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 160px; height: 12px;
  }
  .watch-ring {
    position: absolute; inset: -40px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px solid rgba(0,229,160,0.15); z-index: 1;
  }
  .watch-ring2 {
    position: absolute; inset: -80px; border-radius: 50%;
    border: 1px dashed rgba(0,229,160,0.07); z-index: 1;
  }
  .watch-badge {
    position: absolute; top: -16px; right: -24px; z-index: 3;
    background: var(--danger); border-radius: 6px;
    padding: 6px 12px; font-size: 11px; font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em; text-transform: uppercase; color: #fff;
  }
  .watch-tag {
    position: absolute; bottom: -20px; left: -20px; z-index: 3;
    background: var(--surface); border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    border-radius: 8px; padding: 10px 16px;
    font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted);
  }
  .watch-tag strong { color: var(--text); display: block; font-size: 18px; }
  .watch-copy p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 17px; font-weight: 300; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 24px; }
  .module-pills { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-bottom: 36px; }
  .pill {
    padding: 6px 16px; border-radius: 100px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500; color: var(--muted);
    background: var(--surface);
  }
  .pill.active { border-color: var(--accent); color: var(--accent); background: rgba(0,229,160,0.08); }

  /* ── FEATURES ── */
  #features { padding: 120px 40px; background: var(--bg2); }
  .features-header { text-align: center; max-width: 680px; margin: 0 auto 72px; }
  .features-header p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; margin-top: 16px; }
  .features-grid {
    display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 1px;
    max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--border);
    border: 1px solid var(--border);
    border-radius: 12px; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .feature-card {
    background: var(--bg2); padding: 44px 36px;
    transition: background 0.2s;
    position: relative;
  }
  .feature-card:hover { background: var(--surface); }
  .feature-icon {
    width: 48px; height: 48px; border-radius: 10px;
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
    margin-bottom: 24px; font-size: 22px;
  }
  .fi-green  { background: rgba(0,229,160,0.12); }
  .fi-blue   { background: rgba(0,196,255,0.12); }
  .fi-red    { background: rgba(255,68,88,0.12); }
  .feature-card h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700;
    text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.03em; margin-bottom: 12px;
  }
  .feature-card p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.65; }
  .feature-tag {
    display: inline-block; margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.12em; text-transform: uppercase;
    font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent);
  }

  /* ── DASHBOARD ── */
  #dashboard { padding: 120px 40px; }
  .dashboard-header { max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto 56px; display: flex; align-items: flex-end; justify-content: space-between; }
  .dashboard-header .section-title { margin-bottom: 0; }
  .dash-sub { color: var(--muted); max-width: 400px; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.6; }
  .dashboard-shell {
    max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto;
    background: var(--bg3); border-radius: 16px;
    border: 1px solid var(--border2);
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .dash-topbar {
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
    padding: 16px 24px; border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
    background: var(--bg2);
  }
  .dash-tabs { display: flex; gap: 4px; }
  .tab {
    padding: 6px 18px; border-radius: 6px; font-size: 13px; font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--muted); cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.15s;
  }
  .tab.active { background: var(--surface); color: var(--text); }
  .tab:hover:not(.active) { color: var(--text); }
  .dash-status { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 8px; font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }
  .status-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; background: var(--accent); animation: pulse 2s infinite; }
  .dash-body { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 320px; }
  .dash-main { padding: 28px; border-right: 1px solid var(--border); }
  .heatmap-title { font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 16px; }

  /* Heatmap court */
  .court-wrap { position: relative; width: 100%; max-width: 580px; }
  .court-svg { width: 100%; }
  .dash-side { padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 20px; }
  .stat-row { background: var(--surface); border-radius: 10px; padding: 16px 18px; }
  .stat-row-label { font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 0.1em; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--muted); margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .stat-row-val { font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: 32px; font-weight: 800; color: var(--text); line-height: 1; }
  .stat-row-sub { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); margin-top: 4px; }
  .bar-wrap { margin-top: 10px; }
  .bar-track { height: 4px; background: var(--border2); border-radius: 2px; overflow: hidden; }
  .bar-fill { height: 100%; border-radius: 2px; }
  .bar-fill.green { background: var(--accent); }
  .bar-fill.blue  { background: var(--accent2); }
  .bar-fill.red   { background: var(--danger); }
  .mini-legend { display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 10px; margin-top: 12px; }
  .legend-item { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px; font-size: 12px; color: var(--muted); }
  .legend-dot { width: 8px; height: 8px; border-radius: 50%; }

  /* ── CTA ── */
  #cta {
    padding: 120px 40px;
    background: linear-gradient(180deg, var(--bg) 0%, #061410 100%);
    text-align: center; position: relative; overflow: hidden;
  }
  .cta-glow {
    position: absolute; bottom: -100px; left: 50%; transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 800px; height: 400px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse, rgba(0,229,160,0.1) 0%, transparent 70%);
    pointer-events: none;
  }
  #cta h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display); font-size: clamp(48px, 8vw, 96px);
    font-weight: 900; text-transform: uppercase; line-height: 0.95;
    position: relative; z-index: 1;
  }
  #cta h2 em { font-style: normal; color: var(--accent); }
  #cta p { color: var(--muted); font-size: 18px; margin: 20px auto 48px; max-width: 480px; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .cta-actions { display: flex; gap: 16px; justify-content: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; }

  /* ── FOOTER ── */
  footer {
    padding: 32px 40px; border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
    display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between;
  }
  footer .logo { font-size: 20px; }
  footer p { font-size: 13px; color: var(--muted); }

  /* ── ANIMATIONS ── */
  @keyframes fadeUp {
    from { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(24px); }
    to   { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
  }
  .reveal { opacity: 0; transform: translateY(28px); transition: opacity 0.6s ease, transform 0.6s ease; }
  .reveal.visible { opacity: 1; transform: translateY(0); }
</style>
</head>
<body>

<!-- NAV -->
<nav>
  <div class="logo">DEFEND<span>X</span></div>
  <ul>
    <li><a href="#watch">Watch</a></li>
    <li><a href="#features">Features</a></li>
    <li><a href="#dashboard">Dashboard</a></li>
  </ul>
  <a href="#cta" class="nav-cta">Pre-order</a>
</nav>

<!-- HERO -->
<section class="hero">
  <div class="hero-grid"></div>
  <div class="hero-glow"></div>
  <div class="hero-badge"><span class="badge-dot"></span>Now with AI Defensive Engine v2</div>
  <h1>TRAIN.<br /><em>DEFEND.</em><br />DOMINATE.</h1>
  <p class="hero-sub">The world's first modular training watch engineered for defensive athletes. Real-time feedback. Zero lag. Total edge.</p>
  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a href="#watch" class="btn-primary">Explore Watch</a>
    <a href="#dashboard" class="btn-ghost">View Dashboard</a>
  </div>
  <div class="hero-stats">
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num">0<span>.</span>8<span>ms</span></div>
      <div class="stat-label">Sensor Latency</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num">200<span>+</span></div>
      <div class="stat-label">Motion Metrics</div>
    </div>
    <div class="stat-item">
      <div class="stat-num">96<span>h</span></div>
      <div class="stat-label">Battery Life</div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- WATCH SECTION -->
<section id="watch">
  <div class="watch-layout">
    <div class="watch-visual">
      <div class="watch-ring"></div>
      <div class="watch-ring2"></div>
      <div class="watch-frame">
        <div class="watch-badge">NEW</div>
        <div class="watch-screen">
          <div class="watch-time">09:42</div>
          <div class="watch-metric">
            <div class="watch-metric-item">
              <div class="watch-metric-val">87</div>
              <div class="watch-metric-lbl">React</div>
            </div>
            <div class="watch-metric-item">
              <div class="watch-metric-val">142</div>
              <div class="watch-metric-lbl">BPM</div>
            </div>
            <div class="watch-metric-item">
              <div class="watch-metric-val">A+</div>
              <div class="watch-metric-lbl">Form</div>
            </div>
          </div>
          <!-- Mini arc chart -->
          <svg class="watch-arc" viewBox="0 0 160 12" fill="none" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg">
            <rect width="160" height="4" y="4" rx="2" fill="#1A2A3A"/>
            <rect width="112" height="4" y="4" rx="2" fill="#00E5A0"/>
          </svg>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="watch-tag"><strong>Module 3</strong>Lateral Guard Sensor</div>
    </div>
    <div class="watch-copy">
      <div class="section-label">Smart Modular Training Watch</div>
      <h2 class="section-title">ENGINEERED<br />FOR THE FIELD</h2>
      <p>DefendX clips onto your wrist — and transforms how you train. Swap sensor modules for court, field, or mat. Every movement captured. Every gap in your defense exposed.</p>
      <p>Built from aerospace-grade titanium with an always-on sapphire display. Rated IP68. Survived everything we threw at it.</p>
      <div class="module-pills">
        <span class="pill active">Court Defense</span>
        <span class="pill">Field Guard</span>
        <span class="pill">Mat Control</span>
        <span class="pill">Recovery</span>
        <span class="pill">Strength Track</span>
      </div>
      <a href="#features" class="btn-primary">See All Features</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<!-- FEATURES -->
<section id="features">
  <div class="features-header reveal">
    <div class="section-label">Real-time Defensive Feedback</div>
    <h2 class="section-title">YOUR COACH.<br />YOUR DATA.</h2>
    <p>Six precision sensors map every stance, step, and reaction. The DefendX engine flags weaknesses before your opponent finds them.</p>
  </div>
  <div class="features-grid reveal">
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon fi-green">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9" stroke="#00E5A0" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M8 12l3 3 5-5" stroke="#00E5A0" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Stance Analysis</h3>
      <p>Continuous 3D skeletal mapping tracks your defensive base at 500Hz. Get instant alerts when your center shifts into a vulnerable zone.</p>
      <span class="feature-tag">↗ Active Learning</span>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon fi-blue">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M3 12h4l3-8 4 16 3-8h4" stroke="#00C4FF" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Reaction Speed Index</h3>
      <p>Measures first-step latency against incoming play patterns. Compare your RSI against 10,000 professional defenders in our database.</p>
      <span class="feature-tag">↗ Benchmark Mode</span>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon fi-red">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><path d="M12 2L2 7l10 5 10-5-10-5z" stroke="#FF4458" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5" stroke="#FF4458" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Gap Mapping</h3>
      <p>Predictive AI models the offensive trajectory and overlays coverage gaps in real time. See exactly where you're exposed before the play develops.</p>
      <span class="feature-tag">↗ AI-Powered</span>
    </div>
    <div class="feature-card">
      <div class="feature-icon fi-green">
        <svg width="24" height="24" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1" stroke="#00E5A0" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1" stroke="#00E5A0" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1" stroke="#00E5A0" stroke-width="1.5"/><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1" stroke="#00E5A0" stroke-width="1.5"/></svg>
      </div>
      <h3>Movement Heatmaps</h3>
      <p>Post-session overlays visualize where you spend time on court, identify defensive dead zones, and compare positioning across multiple sessions.</p>
      <span class="feature-tag">↗ Session Review</span>
    </div>
